### list books (paginated)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/books?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### get one book
GET http://localhost:8081/api/books/1
Accept: application/json

### create book (201)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Domain-Driven Design",
  "author": "Eric Evans",
  "isbn": "978-0321125217",
  "publishedYear": 2003
}

### update book
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Effective Java 3rd",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "isbn": "978-0134685991",
  "publishedYear": 2018
}

### delete book (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/books/2

### validation error (400)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "",
  "isbn": "bad",
  "publishedYear": 1000
}

### not found (404)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/books/999999
Accept: application/json
